# Per-worker signing key directories, created and removed by the API test
# suite's global setup. A key directory per worker exists because the signing
# key is registered per DATABASE and written per DIRECTORY — sharing one across
# four worker databases recreates by hand the mismatch keys.ts prevents.
.keys-test-*/
